<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salmon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Donnelley Enterprises Solutions Inc with a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-3/8 at 21-1/8.</p>
</text>
